 "equipment_type": "Variable frequency drive (HVAC fan and pump)",
 "applies_to": "Toshiba International (TIC) Q9 Plus adjustable speed drives for HVAC fans and pumps, using the S4 RS-485 port with F829 set to BACnet.",
 "summary": "The Q9 Plus has BACnet MS/TP on the terminal board's S4 RJ-45 (RS-485) connector when F829 = 2 (BACnet). The object list covers the terminal inputs and relay outputs, status and command BVs (run/stop, direction, fault reset, preset speeds and command/frequency source overrides), the analog inputs and outputs, and AVs for drive monitors, Virtual Linear Pump values, frequency reference, fault codes and ramp times.",
