 "notes": [
  "From the Q9 Plus ASD Installation and Operation Manual (April 2020), BACnet I/O and Values, Tables 4-8 (PDF pp79-84). AV 17, AV 21 and AV 22 are not in the table.",
  "BI 3-5, BI 14-17, AI 3-4 and AO 2-3 need the ETB004Z expansion I/O card.",
  "The terminal functions in the descriptions (e.g. S1 Fire-speed, OUT 1 Open Damper) are the printed defaults and follow the terminal settings.",
  "AV 10 PID Fbck is printed with units Hz.",
  "Fault code meanings for AV 18-20 are in Toshiba's BACnet Option Unit Function Manual, not in this manual.",
  "Toshiba International (industrial drives) is a different company from the Toshiba Carrier VRF products listed under Toshiba."
 ],
